cult-pylon = cult pylon
cult-pylon-desc = A floating crystal that slowly heals those faithful to Nar'Sie.

cult-altar = altar
cult-altar-desc = A bloodstained altar dedicated to Nar'Sie.

cult-daemon-forge = daemon forge
cult-daemon-forge-desc = A forge used in crafting the unholy weapons used by the armies of Nar'Sie.

cult-archives = archives
cult-archives-desc = A desk covered in arcane manuscripts and tomes in unknown languages. Looking at the text makes your skin crawl.

cult-runed-door = runed door
cult-runed-door-desc = It opens, it closes, and maybe crushes you. This one has a strange glowing rune on it.

cult-girder = runed girder
cult-girder-desc = Framework made of a strange and shockingly cold metal. It doesn't seem to have any bolts
